ewski</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>The association between sulfate air pollution and mortality at the county scale: an exploration of the impact of scale on a long-term exposure study</article-title><source>J Toxicol Environ Health A</source><volume>66</volume><fpage>1605</fpage><lpage>1624</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12959832</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b61-ehp0115-000769"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><collab>World Health Organization</collab> 1975. International Classification of Diseases, Ninth Revision. Geneva:World Health Organization.</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b62-ehp0115-000769"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Zanobetti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Canner</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Stone</surname><given-names>PH</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwartz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Sher</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Eagan-Bengston</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Ambient pollution and blood pressure in cardiac rehabilitation patients</article-title><source>Circulation</source><volume>110</volume><fpage>2184</fpage><lpage>2189</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15466639</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b63-ehp0115-000769"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Zanobetti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwartz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>The effect of particulate air pollution on emergency admissions for myocardial infarction: a multicity case-crossover analysis</article-title><source>Environ Health Perspect</source><volume>113</volume><fpage>978</fpage><lpage>982</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16079066